WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.300
Everyone who has always wanted to get their driving licence –

00:02.400 --> 00:03.500
you are in the right place now.

00:03.500 --> 00:06.000
We have opened Easydrive in Haltingen.

00:06.000 --> 00:07.500
And with us you have the chance

00:07.500 --> 00:10.800
to finish your driving licence in 21 days.

00:11.000 --> 00:12.500
And if you sign up now –

00:12.500 --> 00:15.200
in the next two weeks you get 20 percent off.

00:15.400 --> 00:17.600
And the best part: we even pick you up from home.

00:17.600 --> 00:19.800
So, what are you waiting for?
